{"overview":"پس از ورود به یک جنگل کوهستانی ممنوع و خطرناک، خواهران هی‌ناتا و کاورو با خدای مار ترسناک ملاقات می‌کنند و به دوستی عمیق دست می‌یابند! اگرچه در ابتدا ظاهر ترسناکی دارد، این «خدای بدشانسی» خودنام‌گذاری‌شده، خجالتی، تنها و به‌طرز شگفت‌آوری آسان برای گفتگوست. این داستان دوستی غیرمنتظره و ماجراجویی‌های کمدی و دل‌نشینی است که در پی آن می‌آید.","tagline":"","overview_en":"After venturing into a restricted, treacherous mountain forest, siblings Hinata and Kaoru meet a terrifying serpent god and become besties! Despite her initially scary appearance, the self-named “god of misfortune” is awkward, lonely, and surprisingly easy to talk to. This is the tale of an unexpected friendship, and the many comedic, heartfelt adventures that ensue.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":13,"y":2026,"poster":"/q5A8h5rK9OHGiKLfxDgqkqUsQyz.jpg"}],"episodes":13,"crew":["鈴木理人"],"crew_en":["Masato Suzuki"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"موتسومی تامورا","role":"Yamatagimadara / Dara-san (Voice)","photo":"/uvbBIRiBK6GDLEESiYSFWOVlaE4.jpg","en":"Mutsumi Tamura"},{"name":"مینامی تسودا","role":"Hinata Misogiya (Voice)","photo":"/bgPI0vCsH43aZVfBuUcQ91cDBxe.jpg","en":"Minami Tsuda"},{"name":"寺澤百花","role":"Kaoru Misogiya (Voice)","photo":"/lLS7b6k1653tiVwbi6pq9JXzMBW.jpg","en":"Momoka Terasawa"},{"name":"古賀葵","role":"Amane Hasegawa (Voice)","photo":"/uVpwheVV4aPROyY1toYv3v5HSPD.jpg","en":"Aoi Koga"},{"name":"杉田智和","role":"Naomichi Fudegi  (Voice)","photo":"/cv5zuPZySNsHXu24pjKLYCRzJ2J.jpg","en":"Tomokazu Sugita"},{"name":"相沢舞","role":"Miwa Irako (Voice)","photo":"/hdhUtNQPUZZSr9HrrkytKNmAEXG.jpg","en":"Mai Aizawa"},{"name":"سائوری هایامی","role":"","photo":"/gLv9lO7dlUbIsmyJUvgegqAAXki.jpg","en":"Saori Hayami"},{"name":"大塚芳忠","role":"","photo":"/3RHQcrsWnAFK6AifSis1lMq08cR.jpg","en":"Hochu Otsuka"},{"name":"てらそままさき","role":"Narration (Voice)","photo":"/eol7Ul4buAam9SmJDuFIWln0Cd3.jpg","en":"Masaki Terasoma"}],"trailer":"",